#: includes/analytics/class-cr-reviews-top-charts.php:417
msgid "The number of times your store's products were displayed as recommendations on aggregated review forms."
msgstr "Het aantal keren dat de producten van je winkel werden getoond als aanbevelingen op verzamelde beoordelingsformulieren."

#: includes/analytics/class-cr-reviews-top-charts.php:416
msgid "Views"
msgstr "Weergaven"

#: includes/analytics/class-cr-reviews-top-charts.php:269
